entum  what's your read from there  there are different ways to look at this  if you are zooming on the donbass region  for example there is a lot of shelling  going on especially when you look at  towns like chroma trucks or bachmud  which are quite close to sloveyansk  which is a very very important town it  is ukrainian controlled basically the  administrative center of the donetsk  region and this is exactly where russian  forces would like to move into because  as you may remember neighboring luhansk  region there the town cerro donetsk was  the key center to take in to actually  control the entire luhansk region so  we're going to hear a lot more about  slovenians in the coming days but also  about all that indiscriminate shelling  that we've been seeing in the report for  example in hakeef region at the same  time yes it seems like ukrainian forces  also do have a momentum given by western  weapons supplies especially the high  mars they have a range of 50 km of 80  kilometers and can strike various uh  supply chains of russia we have to see  how this develops certainly the war in  ukraine is at a turning point  dw correspondent funny for sure thank  you  you
 

